  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Baseline and Mid-Term Evaluation FOCUS policy framework 2026 - 2030</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To enable accountability and learning, while giving partners the flexibility to develop their own monitoring, evaluation and learning (MEL) systems, the MFA will tender a contract party to: 

- Support partners in finalising their MEL system during the inception phase and harmonise indicators where possible/relevant.
- Perform an external baseline of the policy framework
- Perform and external mid-term evaluation (MTE) of the policy framework 

This assignment for which one contract party will be selected out of the framework agreement for evaluations will focus on the following instruments of the policy framework Focus:
Combating the HIV/AIDS epidemic
Countering harmful practices
Promoting clean and fair trade
Encouraging women&#x2019;s entrepreneurship
Combating violence against women and supporting women human rights defenders
Women, peace and security
Protecting and promoting human rights and fundamental freedoms</narrative>
  </description>
